<!--/Post: 9358-->
<!--Post: 9363--><!--Time: 1109484002-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9363"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 10:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LMAO - &#40;and I&#39;m glad, too&#41; <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t know, you may have been right.  Some people would have quite rightly told a guy measuring the neighbors&#39; grass with a ruler to &#34;get a life&#34;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9363-->
<!--Post: 9763--><!--Time: 1109631624-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9763"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 3:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There is a report out that BTK read this thread and was so angry that he let himself be captured. He knew it was the only way that he could prove he was still alive. &#40;unidentified sources&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
