<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10097"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 12:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He might as well be dead now. This guys life is over. Thank the good lord!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10097-->
<!--Post: 10294--><!--Time: 1109879858-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10294"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The BTK Strangler is dead metaphorically. If, the suspect committed murder after 1994 he could be sentenced to death. Its highly likely the BTK Strangler committed murder after the reintroduction of the death penalty in Kansas.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
